# نسخ إلى backend/.env (مملوء بالقيم الحقيقية)
# القيم المطلوبة للـ SUPABASE إلزامية (بدونها لا يعمل الخادم)

# --- Django ---
DJANGO_SECRET_KEY=
DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE=config.settings.production
DEBUG=False
ALLOWED_HOSTS=afaq.app,www.afaq.app,api.afaq.app

# --- Supabase (مطلوب) ---
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_KEY=
DATABASE_URL=

# --- Redis ---
REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/0

# --- Resend (Email) ---
RESEND_API_KEY=
DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL=Afaq Tech <no-reply@afaq.app>

# --- Sentry ---
SENTRY_DSN_FRONTEND=
SENTRY_DSN_BACKEND=

# --- Gemini (AI) ---
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# --- JWT ---
JWT_PRIVATE_KEY_B64=
JWT_PUBLIC_KEY_B64=

# --- Google OAuth (اختياري حالياً) ---
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=https://api.afaq.app/api/v1/auth/google/callback/
